    "sub_name": "奈米科技與應用",
    "sub_ename": "NANO TECHNOLOGY AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "介紹什麼是奈米科技，並探討相關之物理原理以及現象。再介紹幾種重要的奈米元件，以及目前這些奈米元件的應用，最後探討奈米科技未來可能的趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "The nano-technology is introduced. The related phenomena and physical concepts are investigated. Some important nano-devices and their applications of these nano-devices are introduced. The tendency of nano-technology is also discussed.",
